<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 203 0 R
/E (The CFAA, RA 10173, GDPR, and NIST CSF 2.0 all aim to reduce cybersecurity and technology-related risks. They encourage organizations to protect information, improve security practices, manage risks, and maintain accountability. They also support proper monitoring and response to cybersecurity incidents to reduce possible harm to individuals, organizations, and systems.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
165 0 obj
<<
