/S /P
/P 205 0 R
/E (main difference)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
166 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 206 0 R
/E (The CFAA mainly focuses on preventing unauthorized access, hacking, and other computer-related crimes, while RA 10173 focuses on protecting personal data and privacy in the Philippines. The GDPR also focuses on personal data protection but provides broader rights and stronger requirements for organizations handling personal information. In comparison, the NIST CSF 2.0 is not a law but a flexible cybersecurity framework that helps organizations identify, manage, and respond to cybersecurity risks.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
